#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-C3.rst:12
#: 874d5109c4b34ac09f08e5f01a0ca6ba
msgid ""
"The PixPilot-C3 is a low cost flight controller with fully redundant IMUs. "
"In most cases, an onboard compass is more susceptible to interference, so we"
" removed the onboard compass and used an external compass instead. "
"Integrated high gain buzzer. The PixPilot-C3 flight controller is sold by a "
"range of resellers listed on the makeflyeasy(http://www.makeflyeasy.com)"
msgstr ""
"PixPilot-C3 是一款低成本飞控，具有完全冗余的 "
"IMU。在大多数情况下，机载罗盘更容易受到干扰，因此移除了机载罗盘，改用外置罗盘。集成高增益蜂鸣器。PixPilot-C3 飞控由 "
"makeflyeasy（http://www.makeflyeasy.com）上列出的各经销商销售。"

